				"19CD54A7B8257823"
			]
			description: [
				"Crude distils at &6Hot&r into sour gas, naphtha, kerosene, diesel and heavy oil, with bitumen left behind. Sour gas leaves by the still's vent or the condenser's gas outlet."
				""
				"Kerosene, diesel and heavy oil come out of a column hot, and bitumen is always warm."
			]
			id: "695A658C30C5B030"
