				"695A658C30C5B030"
			]
			description: [
				"The diesel engine is one block built round a steel flywheel. Crank it briskly for two seconds and it catches, running on diesel or, weaker, kerosene, and turning the way it was cranked."
				""
				"Run it dry or overload it and it stalls. Back to the crank."
				""
				"&7JEI: the Diesel Engine tab. Ponder: the diesel engine.&r"
